      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "MICROSOFT ENTRA TENANT\n\nCanada Life tenant root\n\nIdentity controls\n\u2022 MFA + Conditional Access\n\u2022 PIM and access reviews\n\u2022 emergency access accounts\n\u2022 workload identity federation\n\u2022 managed identities\n\nTenant services\n\u2022 Entra groups and app registrations\n\u2022 enterprise PKI/certificates\n\u2022 Microsoft Purview policies\n\u2022 Defender XDR integration\n\nNo standing subscription Owner access; privileged elevation is time-bound and audited.",
      "originalText": "MICROSOFT ENTRA TENANT\n\nCanada Life tenant root\n\nIdentity controls\n\u2022 MFA + Conditional Access\n\u2022 PIM and access reviews\n\u2022 emergency access accounts\n\u2022 workload identity federation\n\u2022 managed identities\n\nTenant services\n\u2022 Entra groups and app registrations\n\u2022 enterprise PKI/certificates\n\u2022 Microsoft Purview policies\n\u2022 Defender XDR integration\n\nNo standing subscription Owner access; privileged elevation is time-bound and audited.",
