      "updated": 1789085894342,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "MANAGEMENT GROUP HIERARCHY\n\nTenant Root\n\u2514\u2500 Canada Life\n   \u251c\u2500 Platform\n   \u2502  \u251c\u2500 Connectivity\n   \u2502  \u251c\u2500 Management & Security\n   \u2502  \u2514\u2500 Identity (tenant services)\n   \u251c\u2500 Landing Zones\n   \u2502  \u2514\u2500 Corp / Regulated\n   \u2502     \u2514\u2500 Intelligent Document Processing\n   \u251c\u2500 Sandbox\n   \u2514\u2500 Decommissioned\n\nPolicy and RBAC inherit downward.\n\nIDP is classified as a regulated corporate landing zone because it processes PII, PHI and financial records.",
      "originalText": "MANAGEMENT GROUP HIERARCHY\n\nTenant Root\n\u2514\u2500 Canada Life\n   \u251c\u2500 Platform\n   \u2502  \u251c\u2500 Connectivity\n   \u2502  \u251c\u2500 Management & Security\n   \u2502  \u2514\u2500 Identity (tenant services)\n   \u251c\u2500 Landing Zones\n   \u2502  \u2514\u2500 Corp / Regulated\n   \u2502     \u2514\u2500 Intelligent Document Processing\n   \u251c\u2500 Sandbox\n   \u2514\u2500 Decommissioned\n\nPolicy and RBAC inherit downward.\n\nIDP is classified as a regulated corporate landing zone because it processes PII, PHI and financial records.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
