      "locked": false,
      "text": "SUBSCRIPTION TOPOLOGY\n\nPLATFORM \u2014 CONNECTIVITY\ncl-plat-connectivity-prd\n\u2022 Canada East and Canada Central hub VNets\n\u2022 ExpressRoute/VPN, Azure Firewall Premium, Bastion, Private DNS Resolver\n\u2022 DDoS Network Protection plan and network monitoring\nOwner: Enterprise Network Services\n\nPLATFORM \u2014 MANAGEMENT & SECURITY\ncl-plat-mgmtsec-prd\n\u2022 Log Analytics, Sentinel, Automation, Monitor Private Link Scope\n\u2022 central immutable audit storage, Defender plans, policy remediation\nOwner: Cloud Platform + Cyber Defence\n\nAPPLICATION LANDING ZONES\ncl-idp-prod\n\u2022 primary and DR workload stamps, production data and integration services\ncl-idp-nonprod\n\u2022 development, test and performance environments; no production data\nOwner: Central IT IDP Platform Team\n\nOptional dedicated subscriptions can be added for exceptionally regulated LOBs without changing the platform contracts.",
      "originalText": "SUBSCRIPTION TOPOLOGY\n\nPLATFORM \u2014 CONNECTIVITY\ncl-plat-connectivity-prd\n\u2022 Canada East and Canada Central hub VNets\n\u2022 ExpressRoute/VPN, Azure Firewall Premium, Bastion, Private DNS Resolver\n\u2022 DDoS Network Protection plan and network monitoring\nOwner: Enterprise Network Services\n\nPLATFORM \u2014 MANAGEMENT & SECURITY\ncl-plat-mgmtsec-prd\n\u2022 Log Analytics, Sentinel, Automation, Monitor Private Link Scope\n\u2022 central immutable audit storage, Defender plans, policy remediation\nOwner: Cloud Platform + Cyber Defence\n\nAPPLICATION LANDING ZONES\ncl-idp-prod\n\u2022 primary and DR workload stamps, production data and integration services\ncl-idp-nonprod\n\u2022 development, test and performance environments; no production data\nOwner: Central IT IDP Platform Team\n\nOptional dedicated subscriptions can be added for exceptionally regulated LOBs without changing the platform contracts.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.23,
