      "text": "INHERITED POLICY INITIATIVES\nAllowed regions: Canada East / Canada Central \u2022 Deny public network access on data services \u2022 Require private endpoints and diagnostic settings\nRequire managed identity, TLS 1.2+, approved SKUs, CMK on document/data stores, tags, budgets and resource locks \u2022 Defender for Cloud enabled\nAKS: private cluster, Entra RBAC, Azure Policy, workload identity, network policy, approved registries and signed images \u2022 Exceptions require expiry, owner and risk acceptance",
      "originalText": "INHERITED POLICY INITIATIVES\nAllowed regions: Canada East / Canada Central \u2022 Deny public network access on data services \u2022 Require private endpoints and diagnostic settings\nRequire managed identity, TLS 1.2+, approved SKUs, CMK on document/data stores, tags, budgets and resource locks \u2022 Defender for Cloud enabled\nAKS: private cluster, Entra RBAC, Azure Policy, workload identity, network policy, approved registries and signed images \u2022 Exceptions require expiry, owner and risk acceptance",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
