      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "IDP PRODUCTION SPOKE VNET \u2014 10.120.0.0/16\n\nsnet-appgw 10.120.1.0/24\nPrivate Application Gateway / internal ingress; end-to-end TLS\n\nsnet-apim 10.120.2.0/24\nAPI Management Premium; internal/private APIs only\n\nsnet-aks-system 10.120.16.0/20\nPrivate AKS system node pool; cluster services and ingress controllers\n\nsnet-aks-workload 10.120.32.0/19\nWeb/API pool \u2022 elastic worker pool \u2022 connector/ingestion pool\nAvailability Zones \u2022 HPA \u2022 cluster autoscaler \u2022 pod disruption budgets\n\nsnet-private-endpoints 10.120.64.0/24\nPrivate endpoints for Blob, Service Bus, Key Vault, ACR, Monitor, Content Understanding and Atlas PrivateLink\n\nsnet-integration 10.120.65.0/24\nPrivate self-hosted integration runtime / managed connectors when required\n\nAll non-local egress follows UDR \u2192 Azure Firewall. AKS API server is private.",
      "originalText": "IDP PRODUCTION SPOKE VNET \u2014 10.120.0.0/16\n\nsnet-appgw 10.120.1.0/24\nPrivate Application Gateway / internal ingress; end-to-end TLS\n\nsnet-apim 10.120.2.0/24\nAPI Management Premium; internal/private APIs only\n\nsnet-aks-system 10.120.16.0/20\nPrivate AKS system node pool; cluster services and ingress controllers\n\nsnet-aks-workload 10.120.32.0/19\nWeb/API pool \u2022 elastic worker pool \u2022 connector/ingestion pool\nAvailability Zones \u2022 HPA \u2022 cluster autoscaler \u2022 pod disruption budgets\n\nsnet-private-endpoints 10.120.64.0/24\nPrivate endpoints for Blob, Service Bus, Key Vault, ACR, Monitor, Content Understanding and Atlas PrivateLink\n\nsnet-integration 10.120.65.0/24\nPrivate self-hosted integration runtime / managed connectors when required\n\nAll non-local egress follows UDR \u2192 Azure Firewall. AKS API server is private.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
