      "updated": 1789085894342,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "REGIONAL / GLOBAL PaaS\n\nStorage accounts\nquarantine, clean, evidence, exchange\nCMK + lifecycle + Defender scan\n\nService Bus Premium\nintake/work queues\npriority lanes, retries, DLQs\noutput topics\n\nMongoDB Atlas\nprocesses, jobs, reviews, model metadata\nbusiness-unit collection scoping\nmulti-region replica set cluster\n\nKey Vault Premium\nCMKs, certificates, secrets\nprivate access only\n\nACR Premium\nsigned images + geo-replication\n\nAzure AI Content Understanding\nrouting/custom analyzers\nprivate endpoint and managed identity\nCanadian availability remains a launch gate",
      "originalText": "REGIONAL / GLOBAL PaaS\n\nStorage accounts\nquarantine, clean, evidence, exchange\nCMK + lifecycle + Defender scan\n\nService Bus Premium\nintake/work queues\npriority lanes, retries, DLQs\noutput topics\n\nMongoDB Atlas\nprocesses, jobs, reviews, model metadata\nbusiness-unit collection scoping\nmulti-region replica set cluster\n\nKey Vault Premium\nCMKs, certificates, secrets\nprivate access only\n\nACR Premium\nsigned images + geo-replication\n\nAzure AI Content Understanding\nrouting/custom analyzers\nprivate endpoint and managed identity\nCanadian availability remains a launch gate",
