      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789085700000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "PRIMARY DATA PATH\nChannel \u2192 Canada Life private network \u2192 internal APIM \u2192 quarantine Blob \u2192 Defender/DLP release \u2192 Service Bus \u2192 AKS worker \u2192 Content Understanding \u2192 Atlas result\nQuality gate \u2192 straight-through delivery or native review queue \u2192 API / Service Bus topic / Event Grid / batch exchange \u2192 downstream claims and case platforms\nEvery hop uses managed identity or Entra token, private DNS/private endpoint where applicable, tenant/process/correlation context, and centralized telemetry.",
      "originalText": "PRIMARY DATA PATH\nChannel \u2192 Canada Life private network \u2192 internal APIM \u2192 quarantine Blob \u2192 Defender/DLP release \u2192 Service Bus \u2192 AKS worker \u2192 Content Understanding \u2192 Atlas result\nQuality gate \u2192 straight-through delivery or native review queue \u2192 API / Service Bus topic / Event Grid / batch exchange \u2192 downstream claims and case platforms\nEvery hop uses managed identity or Entra token, private DNS/private endpoint where applicable, tenant/process/correlation context, and centralized telemetry.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.35,
      "autoResize": true
