      "versionNonce": 1100397878,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789085894342,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "CANADA CENTRAL HUB\n10.101.0.0/16\n\nSame hub pattern as primary\nExpressRoute/VPN reachability\nAzure Firewall Premium\nBastion\nPrivate DNS Resolver\nDDoS plan and diagnostics\n\nRoutes and DNS are pre-provisioned and continuously validated.\n\nFirewall policy is centrally managed and synchronized, with region-specific addresses and explicit failover rules.",
      "originalText": "CANADA CENTRAL HUB\n10.101.0.0/16\n\nSame hub pattern as primary\nExpressRoute/VPN reachability\nAzure Firewall Premium\nBastion\nPrivate DNS Resolver\nDDoS plan and diagnostics\n\nRoutes and DNS are pre-provisioned and continuously validated.\n\nFirewall policy is centrally managed and synchronized, with region-specific addresses and explicit failover rules.",
