      "seed": 2028,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1364561668,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789085894342,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "IDP DR SPOKE \u2014 10.121.0.0/16\n\nMatching subnet plan\n10.121.1.0/24 Application Gateway\n10.121.2.0/24 APIM\n10.121.16.0/20 AKS system\n10.121.32.0/19 AKS workload\n10.121.64.0/24 private endpoints\n10.121.65.0/24 integration\n\nWarm capacity\n\u2022 private AKS system pool online\n\u2022 minimal API/worker replicas\n\u2022 images available in ACR replica\n\u2022 APIM and ingress preconfigured\n\u2022 secrets/certificates recoverable\n\u2022 dashboards and alerts active\n\nScale target is proven by DR load testing, not assumed.",
      "originalText": "IDP DR SPOKE \u2014 10.121.0.0/16\n\nMatching subnet plan\n10.121.1.0/24 Application Gateway\n10.121.2.0/24 APIM\n10.121.16.0/20 AKS system\n10.121.32.0/19 AKS workload\n10.121.64.0/24 private endpoints\n10.121.65.0/24 integration\n\nWarm capacity\n\u2022 private AKS system pool online\n\u2022 minimal API/worker replicas\n\u2022 images available in ACR replica\n\u2022 APIM and ingress preconfigured\n\u2022 secrets/certificates recoverable\n\u2022 dashboards and alerts active\n\nScale target is proven by DR load testing, not assumed.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.23,
      "autoResize": true
    },
