      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789085894342,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "DATA PROTECTION\n\nMongoDB Atlas\nCanada East primary replica set\nCanada Central secondary member\ncontrolled regional failover\n\nBlob Storage\nGZRS/RA-GZRS where supported\nlast-sync monitoring\nimmutable audit replica/backup\n\nService Bus\npaired namespace and configuration\njobs remain durable in Atlas\nreconciliation recreates incomplete work\n\nKey Vault / CMKs\nregional vaults or tested restore pattern\nsoft delete + purge protection\nseparate key custodians\n\nBackups are isolated, immutable, encrypted and restore-tested.",
      "originalText": "DATA PROTECTION\n\nMongoDB Atlas\nCanada East primary replica set\nCanada Central secondary member\ncontrolled regional failover\n\nBlob Storage\nGZRS/RA-GZRS where supported\nlast-sync monitoring\nimmutable audit replica/backup\n\nService Bus\npaired namespace and configuration\njobs remain durable in Atlas\nreconciliation recreates incomplete work\n\nKey Vault / CMKs\nregional vaults or tested restore pattern\nsoft delete + purge protection\nseparate key custodians\n\nBackups are isolated, immutable, encrypted and restore-tested.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.23,
      "autoResize": true
