      "text": "AKS WORKLOADS\n\nWeb console\nProcess catalogue and onboarding\nModel training/promotion UI\nSubmission portal\nReview queue and adjudication workbench\nIT administration and FinOps dashboards\n\nFastAPI control plane\nProcess/model/job/review APIs\nauthorization and tenant policy\ncanonical result API\nhealth and readiness endpoints\n\nWorkers\nquarantine release processor\nrouting/extraction workers\nreview notification workers\noutbound delivery/reconciliation workers\nscheduled cleanup and retention jobs",
