      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ENTERPRISE INTEGRATIONS\n\nInbound\nAPIM REST products\nService Bus/Event Grid subscriptions\nenterprise MFT/SFTP\nMicrosoft Graph shared-mailbox connector\ngoverned Blob exchange\n\nOutbound\nsynchronous canonical result API\nService Bus topics by domain/LOB\nEvent Grid lifecycle events\ngoverned batch exchange\nnotifications through approved enterprise communication service\n\nConsumers\nclaims and case management\npolicy administration\npayments\nrecords management\nfraud/risk services\nanalytics and reporting\n\nAcknowledgement and replay are correlated to the durable job record.",
      "originalText": "ENTERPRISE INTEGRATIONS\n\nInbound\nAPIM REST products\nService Bus/Event Grid subscriptions\nenterprise MFT/SFTP\nMicrosoft Graph shared-mailbox connector\ngoverned Blob exchange\n\nOutbound\nsynchronous canonical result API\nService Bus topics by domain/LOB\nEvent Grid lifecycle events\ngoverned batch exchange\nnotifications through approved enterprise communication service\n\nConsumers\nclaims and case management\npolicy administration\npayments\nrecords management\nfraud/risk services\nanalytics and reporting\n\nAcknowledgement and replay are correlated to the durable job record.",
