      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "DELIVERY PLATFORM\n\nGitHub Enterprise\nprotected branches and environments\nCODEOWNERS and security review\nOIDC federation; no long-lived Azure secrets\n\nInfrastructure\nBicep modules for ALZ integration, networks, AKS and PaaS\nwhat-if, policy and security scanning\nseparate prod/nonprod deployment identities\n\nApplication delivery\ncontainer build and SBOM\nvulnerability/signature checks\nACR Premium\nGitOps/Flux or controlled Helm deployment\nprogressive rollout and rollback\n\nModel delivery\nevaluation evidence\nmodel builder/approver separation\nversioned analyzers\ncanary and rollback\nimmutable promotion record",
