      "locked": false,
      "text": "OPERATIONS & ASSURANCE\n\nAzure Monitor\nApplication Insights\nmanaged Prometheus/Grafana\nLog Analytics\nAKS/Firewall/Private Link diagnostics\n\nMicrosoft Sentinel\nSOC analytics, incidents and automation\n\nDefender\nCloud posture, containers, storage malware and vulnerability management\n\nFinOps\nbudgets, anomaly alerts, per-LOB showback for pages, storage, AI and review\n\nRecords\nsource documents: 90 days\nextraction/review: 7 years\nimmutable audit: 7 years\nlegal hold override\n\nSRE\n24x7 alerting for production\nservice catalogue, SLOs, capacity and runbooks",
      "originalText": "OPERATIONS & ASSURANCE\n\nAzure Monitor\nApplication Insights\nmanaged Prometheus/Grafana\nLog Analytics\nAKS/Firewall/Private Link diagnostics\n\nMicrosoft Sentinel\nSOC analytics, incidents and automation\n\nDefender\nCloud posture, containers, storage malware and vulnerability management\n\nFinOps\nbudgets, anomaly alerts, per-LOB showback for pages, storage, AI and review\n\nRecords\nsource documents: 90 days\nextraction/review: 7 years\nimmutable audit: 7 years\nlegal hold override\n\nSRE\n24x7 alerting for production\nservice catalogue, SLOs, capacity and runbooks",
