      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "lz-f4",
      "index": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2046,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 3046,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789085700000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "PHYSICAL DESIGN DECISIONS\n\u2022 Shared enterprise landing zone services are separated from the IDP workload subscriptions; production and non-production never share data-plane resources.\n\u2022 No internet-facing application endpoint is deployed. Application Gateway, APIM, AKS, data stores, keys, registry, monitoring ingestion and AI endpoints use private connectivity.\n\u2022 Business-unit tenant ID is enforced consistently in identity claims, APIM policy, queue/session metadata, Atlas collections, Blob paths, quotas and chargeback.\n\u2022 CIDRs, SKUs and capacity are planning defaults. Final approval requires enterprise IPAM, dependency quotas, performance tests, threat modelling and DR evidence.\n\u2022 Content Understanding in Canada is a future-state assumption and explicit production launch gate until Microsoft regional availability is verified.",
      "originalText": "PHYSICAL DESIGN DECISIONS\n\u2022 Shared enterprise landing zone services are separated from the IDP workload subscriptions; production and non-production never share data-plane resources.\n\u2022 No internet-facing application endpoint is deployed. Application Gateway, APIM, AKS, data stores, keys, registry, monitoring ingestion and AI endpoints use private connectivity.\n\u2022 Business-unit tenant ID is enforced consistently in identity claims, APIM policy, queue/session metadata, Atlas collections, Blob paths, quotas and chargeback.\n\u2022 CIDRs, SKUs and capacity are planning defaults. Final approval requires enterprise IPAM, dependency quotas, performance tests, threat modelling and DR evidence.\n\u2022 Content Understanding in Canada is a future-state assumption and explicit production launch gate until Microsoft regional availability is verified.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.35,
      "autoResize": true
    }
  ]
